    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs): Named dye or pigment (annotto, orchella, weld, rock moss = orchil lichen per Mortimer 1823 s.v. ROCK MOSS 'See ORCHILLA', vermilion, zaffre, verdigris, lampblack) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 1 rows, 1809–1809. Series: CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×1. Units: Boxes ×1. Top routes: Quebec QC → Great Britain ×1."@en ;
